# Acquired GIS vectors: reproducible from data/acquire.py in ~90s, and the
# tree-canopy neighbourhood polygons alone are 31 MB. The provenance sidecars
# and manifest are kept -- they are the record of what was fetched, and carry
# the sha256 to check a refetch against.
/data/gis/**/*.geojson
/data/real/extents_*.json
/data/real/download.log
